From b6d7673a3f8fc62702e3ffe7ff27f9902e9ce83d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 10:35:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Changelog and usage guide: notices of a new personal chat

The changelog item (all seven languages) and its coverage in the usage
guide, which the alpha test requires before an item can ship:

- the Contact bullet of "Dados da conversa" now also lists the
  end-to-end encryption notice;
- a new paragraph under "Nova conversa" says that the empty-chat row
  carries the encryption notice and the disappearing-messages timer.

The guide sections are edited in all seven languages, the generated
guides are regenerated with gerar_guia.py, and the item is registered
in cobertura.json with verificar_guia.py --registrar. No "desde" badge,
as in the previous coverage commits.
